WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:06.400
SCP-096 Vs the M134 Minigun, the world’s&nbsp;
fastest machine gun: Who would win?

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:11.360
The M134 Minigun is a truly terrifying&nbsp;
piece of tech, capable of firing around&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:17.040
six thousand 7.62 mm rounds per minute, often&nbsp;
eliminating even the hardiest of targets.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.520
But what about SCP-096?

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:23.040
Well, as we have learned from some of the&nbsp;
other mind-blowing videos on our channel,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:27.760
if there is a way to defeat The Shy Guy,&nbsp;
conventional arms fire certainly isn’t it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:32.560
The SCP Foundation has fought 096 with&nbsp;
heavy machine guns on a number of occasions,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:36.080
and on some of these, the bullets&nbsp;
didn’t even slow the monster down.

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:41.840
If you see this beast’s face, we’re sorry to say&nbsp;
that even the M134 Minigun will not save you.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:45.360
Go watch our 096 videos now and see for yourself!

